    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Cub Inventory QAS — Observabilidad",
      "id": 100,
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Bienvenido\nStack **Prometheus + Loki + Tempo + Alloy + Grafana + Alertmanager** (OpenTelemetry).\n\n| Dashboard | Que demuestra (PDF) |\n|---|---|\n| **API Overview** | Throughput, latencia p95, API UP, heap, logs correlacionados |\n| **Infra** | CPU, JVM, threads, pool HikariCP |\n| **Business** | Productos activos, stock critico, valor inventario, trafico de negocio |\n| **Security** | 401/403, denegaciones, logs con `user` + `endpoint`, login Keycloak |\n\n**Como usar en defensa:** genera trafico en la app (login admin, dashboard, productos) y refresca estos paneles (ultimos 15–60 min)."
      }
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "DOWN", "color": "red" }, "1": { "text": "UP", "color": "green" } } }
          ],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 } ] }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "id": 1,
      "title": "API",
      "type": "stat",
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "up{job=\"inventory-api\"}", "legendFormat": "api" }]
